{"id":6654,"date":"2021-06-03T20:00:21","date_gmt":"2021-06-03T19:00:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=6654"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:01:48","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:01:48","slug":"numeros-durgence","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/numeros-durgence\/","title":{"rendered":"Num\u00e9ros d\u2019urgence lors de pannes d\u2019op\u00e9rateurs"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Dans le Bas-Rhin, les num\u00e9ros d\u2019urgence 15, 18, 112.<\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Des num\u00e9ros d\u2019urgence \u00e0 10 chiffres sont toujours joignables en cas de panne d&rsquo;op\u00e9rateur :<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sapeurs-pompiers du Bas-Rhin : composez le 18 depuis une ligne fixe ou le 03 88 11 18 67.<\/li>\n<li>SAMU du Bas-Rhin : composez le 15 depuis une ligne fixe ou le 03 88 87 90 15 ou le 03 88 87 91 12.<\/li>\n<li>Police du Bas-Rhin : composez le 17 ou, uniquement en cas de dysfonctionnements, contactez le 03 90 23 17 17 ou le bureau de Police de Hoenheim au\u00a003 69 73 88 30.<\/li>\n<li>Gendarmerie du Bas-Rhin : composez le 17 depuis une ligne fixe\/mobile, ou\u00a0la\u00a0Gendarmerie de Mundolsheim au\u00a003 88 19 07 67,\u00a0ou en cas de difficult\u00e9s persistantes, composez le 06 07 78 35 60.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>En cas de difficult\u00e9s \u00e0 joindre ces num\u00e9ros, veuillez renouveler votre appel depuis un autre op\u00e9rateur et\/ou depuis une ligne fixe.<\/p>\n<p>Retrouvez l&rsquo;ensemble des num\u00e9ros utiles ainsi que le plan de la ville de Hoenheim au format pdf sur notre page : <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/numerosdurgence-plandelaville\/?fbclid=IwAR0Id2ld3T2WHVbVf5cZACMFXFP2vDXOZuX5opvF_pfX57ETtn1QCpleFuU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/numerosdurgence-plandelaville\/<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dans le Bas-Rhin, les num\u00e9ros d\u2019urgence 15, 18, 112.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":6662,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31,76],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6654"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6654"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6654\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7129,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6654\/revisions\/7129"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/6662"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6654"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=6654"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=6654"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}